---
const faqs = [
  {
    question:
      "Can you connect data from multiple business systems?",
    answer:
      "Yes, where suitable access or integration methods are available. The first step is understanding the systems, data structures and how information should relate across them.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can dashboards update automatically?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Depending on the source systems and architecture, dashboards and reports can use scheduled refreshes or near-real-time data.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Do we need a data warehouse?",
    answer:
      "Not necessarily. The appropriate architecture depends on data volume, number of sources, reporting complexity and long-term requirements.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can you build management and executive dashboards?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Dashboards can be designed for executives, managers, operational teams or specific departments with information appropriate to each audience.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can existing spreadsheets be included?",
    answer:
      "Often, yes. Spreadsheets can be part of the initial data environment, though long-term reliability may benefit from moving important processes into more structured systems.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can LKP help define the KPIs themselves?",
    answer:
      "Yes. KPI work should begin by understanding objectives and operations so the organisation tracks meaningful indicators rather than arbitrary metrics.",
  },
];
---

<section class="da-faq">
  <div class="site-container da-faq__layout">
    <div>
      <p>Data & analytics FAQ</p>

      <h2>
        Before building the dashboard.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="da-faq__list">
      {
        faqs.map((faq) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .da-faq {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .da-faq__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(16rem, .68fr)
      minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 8rem);
  }

  .da-faq__layout
    > div:first-child > p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #0b2f8f;
    font-size: .64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .da-faq h2 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: #0d203c;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .da-faq__list {
    border-top: 1px solid #dce3ec;
  }

  .da-faq details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dce3ec;
    padding-block: 1rem;
  }

  .da-faq summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #293b53;
    font-size: .76rem;
    font-weight: 740;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .da-faq details p {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: .75rem 0 0;
    color: #788497;
    font-size: .69rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .da-faq__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
